if late:
 lines+=['','## Late grasp/lift observations','','Supplementary 90 real-model calls at 75% of each trajectory and five frames before its end, with only valid future horizons; separate `results/offline_action_metrics_late_phase.csv`. These anchors cover observation states excluded by full 40-step-window sampling. Phase labels are fractional trajectory anchors, not manual semantic event annotations.']
