if newrgb:
 rs=newrgb['rgb_samples'];lines+=['','## Corrected dataset verification','','All 50 new episodes pass official LeRobotEpisodeLoader, matching original action parquet hashes and statistics. New 150 first-frame RGB pairs: correct-source MAE '+str(float(np.mean([r['rgb_mae'] for r in rs])))+', swapped-source MAE '+str(float(np.mean([r['swapped_mae'] for r in rs])))+'. All favor correct RGB. New dataset footprint about 45MB; raw source JPEGs and old datasets remain unchanged.']
lines+=['','## Execution constraints','','ALOHA simulation URDF nominal joint bounds are ±10rad and velocity limits 1000rad/s; passing those checks does not guarantee plausible motion. The 2rad/s trial adds a real per-60ms target-step bound. Original expert nominal per-joint 99th percentile velocities range 0.18–1.94rad/s; boundary timing uncertainty is documented in `expert_nominal_velocity_statistics.json`. A real-joint-state trial changes only feedback state and does not substitute expert actions.']
capped=read('evaluation/expert_interface_replay_seed1_source1_v2.json')
if capped:lines+=['','Expert replay with the 2rad/s cap also passes official success at '+str(capped['actions'])+' targets. Therefore failure of the capped model rollout is not evidence that the cap itself makes this source task impossible.']
