for r in results:lines.append(f"| {r['tag']} | {r['seed']} | {r['seed'] in train_seeds} | {r['execute_horizon']} | {r['physics_steps_per_action']} | {r.get('measured_state',False)}/{r.get('measured_control_start',False)} | {r.get('velocity_limit')} | {r.get('denoising_steps')}/{r.get('sampling_ensemble')} | {r['success']} | {r.get('actions',len(np.load(root / ('evaluation/lift_pot_gr00t_'+r['tag']+'_seed'+str(r['seed'])+'_actions.npz'))['executed']))} | {r.get('error','')} |")
lines+=['','Expert original episode 1 / seed 1 replay: official success; 105 targets; not counted above.','', 'Predictions, executed targets and observed states are saved per rollout as NPZ; per-call tracking/grasp distances in JSON; raw simulation videos retained. Results should be grouped by one fixed tag/configuration. Training scenes are excluded from independent formal rates. Repeated seeds for factor comparisons are paired diagnostics, not new independent test seeds.','',f"Recorded completed recovery rollouts: {len(results)}; successes {sum(r['success'] for r in results)}. This total mixes diagnostics/configurations and is not a formal success rate.",'','No success delivery video is named `videos/01_lift_pot_gr00t.mp4` unless an actual recorded model rollout passes the official check.','', '## 尚未完成','','本轮 7 个训练场景诊断与 2 个独立 seed 评测均失败；训练场景不计正式成功率。相同 h40 配置下独立评测为 0/2，样本量不足以宣称稳定成功率。尚未达到一次真实模型成功，因此未生成成功命名视频，20 种子正式验证和多任务扩展未完成。新训练尚未启动，按用户第 5 部分要求等待超过一小时训练的确认。','','## Reproduction','','```bash','source scripts/project_env.sh','.venvs/robotwin/bin/python scripts/replay_lift_pot_interface.py --seed 1 --source-episode 1','.venvs/gr00t/bin/python scripts/offline_recovery_metrics.py','.venvs/robotwin/bin/python scripts/audit_live_source_scene.py','.venvs/gr00t/bin/python scripts/audit_processor_roundtrip.py','# Server in separate terminal:','.venvs/gr00t/bin/python -u scripts/serve_gr00t_local.py --denoising-steps 4','# Use a NEW tag to preserve videos:','.venvs/robotwin/bin/python -u scripts/evaluate_lift_pot_gr00t.py --start-seed 1 --episodes 1 --max-actions 200 --execute-horizon 5 --control fixed --match-legacy-training-channels --tag recovery_new','```','', 'Graphics recovery (container-only): `apt-get install -y libegl1 libgl1 libglvnd0 vulkan-tools`. Existing Python virtualenvs are reused. Exact current versions in `configs/recovery_*_versions.json`.']
lines+=['','## New data reproduction (creation refuses to overwrite existing versions)\n\n```bash\nsource scripts/project_env.sh\n# Builders are for a fresh destination; preserve current completed datasets.\n.venvs/robotwin/bin/python scripts/build_correct_rgb_dataset.py\n.venvs/data_conversion/bin/python scripts/build_rgb_terminal_pad_dataset.py\nbash scripts/refresh_terminal_pad_stats.sh\n.venvs/gr00t/bin/python scripts/check_terminal_pad_sampler.py\n```\n\nOnly NEW v23 training statistics are recomputed; validation/test copy those training statistics. Pre-refresh caches remain preserved. Existing A metadata/weights/data are unchanged. The B proposal is prepared in `configs/lift_pot_rgb_B_proposal.json`; its estimated >1h GPU run has not started.']
